 "placeholder": 
 "{First name}", 
 "type": 
 "text", 
 "required": 
 true, 
 "hidden": 
 false, 
 "options": 
 [] 
 } 

And since you use a dot in IDs, that we use as a separator for nested objects/parameters, on our end it looked like this when we set the value to that field: 











 " 5b361ad1b82342 ": 
 { 
 " 33286937 ": 
 "value" 
 } 




 Instead of: 







 { " 5b361ad1b82342.33286937 ": 
 "value" 
 } 



